# Copy to .env and fill in only what you actually have configured.
# ShiftFit works fully without any of these set: local text parsing, manual
# scheduling, auto-fill, and localStorage persistence all work with zero config.

# Base URL of your n8n instance (or a fronting API gateway), used for:
#  - image/screenshot schedule extraction (Workflow A, docs/N8N_ARCHITECTURE.md)
#  - publishing an approved schedule to Google Calendar (Workflow C)
# Leave empty to run fully local: text parsing always works, image import is
# disabled with an explanation, and "Publish schedule" uses a local mock that
# never claims a real Google Calendar sync happened.
VITE_AUTOMATION_API_URL=
